    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code></a> that serves as a base class for store specific implementations for\nconfiguring audit support. Registers a <a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditingHandler</code></a> based on the provided configuration(\n<a href=\"AuditingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.auditing.config\"><code>AuditingConfiguration</code></a>).",
      "translation": "一个作为存储特定实现基类的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code></a>，用于配置审计支持。它会根据提供的配置（<a href=\"AuditingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.auditing.config\"><code>AuditingConfiguration</code></a>）注册一个 <a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditingHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html#registerBeanDefinitions(org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata,org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\">registerBeanDefinitions</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\">ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html#registerBeanDefinitions(org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata,org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry)\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.context.annotation 中的\">registerBeanDefinitions</a></code> 在接口<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.context.annotation 中的\">ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</a></code>中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/AbstractBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>AbstractBeanDefinition</code></a> for the <a href=\"AuditingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.auditing.config\"><code>AuditingConfiguration</code></a>.",
